# TejasAI Client Environment Configuration
# Optional: Specify an explicit backend API URL.
# If omitted or left blank, the frontend defaults to '/api' which is proxied
# to http://localhost:5000 by Vite during development.
# For decoupled production deployments, point this to your deployed backend:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
